g-title elementor-size-default\">About Lambs on the Road</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3b78284 elementor-section-full_width fc-game-genres elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3b78284\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f0a5de7\" data-id=\"f0a5de7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d549bd6 fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d549bd6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Apocalyptic Fiction</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f6fd7c fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1f6fd7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Platform</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95f1235 fc-game-genre elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"95f1235\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Narrative</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1b2ae5 fc-game-description elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d1b2ae5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Society as we know it has ceased to exist. Help John find his little Mary, in a path full of obstacles, monsters and suffering that separate you from your only purpose: to save your child.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c920cc5 fc-game-description elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c920cc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Live an indie adventure full of horror and despair, a 2D side-scrolling platformer, with puzzles that will awaken your ingenuity to make our protagonist escape without a scratch from the city.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2273998 fc-game-description elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2273998\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Try to escape from human despair: hide, run, fight, kill, but always remember… never look back.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-697ccb5 elementor-section-full_width fc-game-features-media elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"697ccb5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-52 elementor-top-column elementor